+- `vp check` passes on changed JavaScript/TypeScript/Markdown files.
+- TypeScript typecheck passes.
+- Rust `cargo check --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml` passes on the Mac with
+  existing repository warnings.
+- Isolated logger tests pass, including multi-video accumulation, failed export
+  retention, Windows-safe export reopening logic, path scrubbing, queue drops,
+  and 64 MiB log rotation.
+
+Native Windows WASAPI, WebView2 scheduling, D3D rendering, and the original
+unattended playback symptom still require the Windows run above. Do not claim
+the original bug is resolved until that run produces correlated evidence.
+
+## Transfer current uncommitted changes
+
+The companion `harbor-windows-debug.patch` includes the current code changes and
+new diagnostics/tests, including this handoff. Apply it only after checking the
+Windows checkout status and matching the base commit above:
+
+```powershell
+git status --short
+git apply --check harbor-windows-debug.patch
+git apply harbor-windows-debug.patch
+```
+
+Do not overwrite existing Windows edits or reset that checkout. Inspect and merge
+conflicts if it has diverged. The patch contains source only, not downloaded
+sidecars, macOS build artifacts, credentials, or the supplied private media log.
+
+A release build retains the new structured diagnostics and accumulated player
+logs too. After diagnosing with the debug build, repeat performance measurements
+in a release build because debug compilation can change timing.
